{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q406", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-vazhakku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-grammar-vazhakku-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வழக்கு வகைகளையும் அவற்றிற்குரிய பொருத்தமான சான்றுகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\n1. இலக்கணப் போலி\n2. மரூஉ\n3. இடக்கரடக்கல்\n4. மங்கலம்\n\nபட்டியல் II:\na. கால் கழுவி வந்தான்\nb. புறநகர்\nc. விளக்கை குளிரவை\nd. கோவை"}], "options": {"A": "1-d, 2-b, 3-c, 4-a", "B": "1-b, 2-d, 3-a, 4-c", "C": "1-a, 2-c, 3-b, 4-d", "D": "1-c, 2-a, 3-d, 4-b"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் இயல் 1 பக்கம் 16-17: இலக்கணப் போலி - புறநகர் (1-b); மரூஉ - கோவை (2-d); இடக்கரடக்கல் - கால் கழுவி வந்தான் (3-a); மங்கலம் - விளக்கை குளிரவை (4-c). சரியான வரிசை 1-b, 2-d, 3-a, 4-c (தெரிவு B)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the forms of Vazhakku with their exemplary usages:\nList I:\n1. Ilakkana-p-Poli\n2. Maruu\n3. Idakkaradakkal\n4. Mangalam\n\nList II:\na. Kaal kazhuvi vanthan\nb. Puranagar\nc. Vilakkai kuliravai\nd. Kovai"}], "options": {"A": "1-d, 2-b, 3-c, 4-a", "B": "1-b, 2-d, 3-a, 4-c", "C": "1-a, 2-c, 3-b, 4-d", "D": "1-c, 2-a, 3-d, 4-b"}, "explanation": "Ilakkana-p-Poli matches Puranagar (b), Maruu matches Kovai (d), Idakkaradakkal matches Kaal kazhuvi vanthan (a), Mangalam matches Vilakkai kuliravai (c). Sequence: 1-b, 2-d, 3-a, 4-c. Key B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "இலக்கணப் போலி (முன்தோன்றிய போலி)", "content_en": "Ilakkana-p-Poli"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "மரூஉ", "content_en": "Maruu"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "இடக்கரடக்கல்", "content_en": "Idakkaradakkal"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "மங்கலம்", "content_en": "Mangalam"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "கால் கழுவி வந்தான்", "content_en": "Kaal kazhuvi vanthan"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "புறநகர் (நகர்ப்புறம்)", "content_en": "Puranagar"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "விளக்கை குளிரவை (அணை)", "content_en": "Vilakkai kuliravai"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "கோவை (கோயம்புத்தூர்)", "content_en": "Kovai"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 16, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "vazhakku", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q407", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-vazhakku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-grammar-poli-types-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "போலி வகைகளையும் அவற்றிற்குரிய சொற்களையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\n1. முதற்போலி\n2. இடைப்போலி\n3. கடைப்போலி\n4. முற்றுப்போலி\n\nபட்டியல் II:\na. பந்தர்\nb. பைசல்\nc. அஞ்சு\nd. அமைச்சு"}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-d, 2-a, 3-b, 4-c", "C": "1-b, 2-d, 3-a, 4-c", "D": "1-c, 2-d, 3-b, 4-a"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் இயல் 1 பக்கம் 18: முதற்போலி - பைசல் (பசல்) (1-b); இடைப்போலி - அமைச்சு (அமச்சு) (2-d); கடைப்போலி - பந்தர் (பந்தல்) (3-a); முற்றுப்போலி - அஞ்சு (ஐந்து) (4-c). சரியான வரிசை 1-b, 2-d, 3-a, 4-c (தெரிவு C)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the forms of Poli with their exemplary words:\nList I:\n1. Mutharpoli\n2. Idaippoli\n3. Kadaippoli\n4. Mutruppoli\n\nList II:\na. Panthar\nb. Paisal\nc. Anju\nd. Amaichu"}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-d, 2-a, 3-b, 4-c", "C": "1-b, 2-d, 3-a, 4-c", "D": "1-c, 2-d, 3-b, 4-a"}, "explanation": "Mutharpoli: Paisal (b); Idaippoli: Amaichu (d); Kadaippoli: Panthar (a); Mutruppoli: Anju (c). Order: 1-b, 2-d, 3-a, 4-c. Key C."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "முதற்போலி", "content_en": "Mutharpoli"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "இடைப்போலி", "content_en": "Idaippoli"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "கடைப்போலி", "content_en": "Kadaippoli"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "முற்றுப்போலி", "content_en": "Mutruppoli"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "பந்தர் (பந்தல்)", "content_en": "Panthar"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "பைசல் (பசல்)", "content_en": 