{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q410", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-08-pothu-ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-grammar-adukkuthodar-emotions-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அடுக்குத்தொடர் உணர்த்தும் உணர்ச்சிக் காரணங்களையும் அவற்றுக்குரிய தொடர்களையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\n1. விரைவு\n2. வெகுளி\n3. உவகை\n4. அச்சம்\n\nபட்டியல் II:\na. வா வா வா!\nb. போ போ போ!\nc. வாருங்கள் வாருங்கள்!\nd. தீ தீ தீ!"}], "options": {"A": "1-c, 2-d, 3-a, 4-b", "B": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "C": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c", "D": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் இயல் 2 பக்கம் 40: விரைவு - வா வா வா (1-a); வெகுளி - போ போ போ (2-b); உவகை - வாருங்கள் வாருங்கள் (3-c); அச்சம் - தீ தீ தீ (4-d). சரியான வரிசை 1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d (தெரிவு B)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the emotive causes of Adukkuthodar with corresponding utterances:\nList I:\n1. Haste\n2. Anger\n3. Joy\n4. Fear\n\nList II:\na. Vaa Vaa Vaa!\nb. Po Po Po!\nc. Vaarungal Vaarungal!\nd. Thee Thee Thee!"}], "options": {"A": "1-c, 2-d, 3-a, 4-b", "B": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "C": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c", "D": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a"}, "explanation": "Haste is Vaa Vaa (a), Anger is Po Po (b), Joy is Vaarungal Vaarungal (c), Fear is Thee Thee (d). Order: 1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d. Key B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "விரைவு", "content_en": "Haste / Speed"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "வெகுளி (கோபம்)", "content_en": "Anger / Fury"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "உவகை (மகிழ்ச்சி)", "content_en": "Joy / Delight"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "அச்சம்", "content_en": "Fear / Dread"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "வா வா வா!", "content_en": "Vaa Vaa Vaa!"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "போ போ போ!", "content_en": "Po Po Po!"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "வாருங்கள் வாருங்கள்!", "content_en": "Vaarungal Vaarungal!"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "தீ தீ தீ!", "content_en": "Thee Thee Thee!"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 40, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "adukkuthodar", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q411", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-vazhakku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-kalaichorkal-master-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "7-ஆம் வகுப்பு பருவம் 3 கலைச்சொற்களை அவற்றுக்குரிய தமிழ்ச் சொற்களோடு பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\n1. Civilization\n2. Folktale\n3. Compassion\n4. Metaphor\n\nபட்டியல் II:\na. நாட்டுப்புறக்கதை\nb. நாகரிகம்\nc. உருவகம்\nd. கருணை"}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a", "C": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c", "D": "1-c, 2-d, 3-a, 4-b"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் கலைச்சொற்கள்: Civilization - நாகரிகம் (1-b); Folktale - நாட்டுப்புறக்கதை (2-a); Compassion - கருணை (3-d); Metaphor - உருவகம் (4-c). சரியான வரிசை 1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c (தெரிவு C)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the official English technical terms with correct Tamil equivalents:\nList I:\n1. Civilization\n2. Folktale\n3. Compassion\n4. Metaphor\n\nList II:\na. Nattuppurakkathai\nb. Nagarigam\nc. Uruvagam\nd. Karunai"}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a", "C": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c", "D": "1-c, 2-d, 3-a, 4-b"}, "explanation": "Civilization is Nagarigam (b), Folktale is Nattuppurakkathai (a), Compassion is Karunai (d), Metaphor is Uruvagam (c). Order: 1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c. Key C."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "Civilization", "content_en": "Civilization"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "Folktale", "content_en": "Folktale"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "Compassion", "content_en": "Compassion"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "Metaphor", "content_en": "Metaphor"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "நாட்டுப்புறக்கதை", "content_en": "Folktale"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "நாகரிகம்", "content_en": "Civilization"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "உருவகம்", "content_en": "Metaphor"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "கருணை", "content_en": "Compassion"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 20, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["kalaichorkal", "vocabulary", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q412", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-06-aram-ennum-kadhir", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-grammar-punarchi-rules", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'சாந்தம் + உடையோர் = சாந்தமுடையோர்' மற்றும் 'முதுமை + மொழி = முதுமொழி' ஆகிய சொற்கள் புணரும் முறைகளுக்குப் பொருந்தும் சரியான புணர்ச்சி விதிகள் யாவை?"}], "options": {"A": "உடம்படுமெய் புணர்ச்சி; திசைப்பெயர் புணர்ச்சி", "B": "தனிக்குறில் முன் ஒற்று உயிர்வரின் இரட்டும்; முன்னின்ற மெய்திரிதல்", "C": "மகர ஈற்றுப் புணர்ச்சி (கெடுதல்); உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டோடும்", "D": "மவ்வீறு ஒற்று அழிந்து உயிர் ஒன்றுதல் / உடல்மேல் உயிர் ஒன்றுதல்; ஈறுபோதல்"}, "explanation": "இலக்கண விதி: 'சாந்தம் + உடையோர்' என்பதில் 'மவ்வீறு ஒற்று அழிந்து உயிரீறு ஒப்பவும்' விதியால் 'ம்' அழிந்து 'த்' உடன் உயிர் இணையலாம் அல்லது மகரமெய்யோடு 'உ' இணைந்து 'மு' வாகி உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே எனப் புணரும். 'முதுமை + மொழி' என்பதில் 'ஈறுபோதல்' விதியால் பண்புப்பெயர் 'மை' விகுதி கெட்டு 'முதுமொழி' எனப் புணர்ந்தது. எனவே தெரிவு D மிகச்சரியானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What are the correct Sandhi rules governing 'Santham + Udaiyor = Santhamudaiyor' and 'Muthumai + Mozhi = Muthumozhi'?"}], "options": {"A": "Udambadumei sandhi; Directional sandhi", "B": "Short monosyllable consonant doubling; Front consonant mutation", "C": "Makara-ending elision; U-elision before vowel", "D": "Makara-ending elision & consonant-vowel union; Eerupothal"}, "explanation": "In Santham + Udaiyor, consonant-vowel union occurs; in Muthumai + Mozhi, 'Eerupothal' drops the characteristic suffix 'mai' yielding Muthumozhi. Key D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 25, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "punarchi", "application"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q413", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-08-pothu-ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-grammar-thinai-paal-mudibu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பின்வரும் வாக்கியங்களில் திணை, பால் மற்றும் எண் முடிபுகள் எவ்வித இலக்கண வழுவுமின்றிச் சரியாக அமைந்துள்ள தொடர் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "'மாடுகள் புல் மேய்ந்தன' மற்றும் 'செழியன் பாடம் படித்தான்'", "B": "'மாடுகள் புல் மேய்ந்தது' மற்றும் 'கண்ணகி பாடம் படித்தான்'", "C": "'செழியன் ஊருக்கு வந்தாள்' மற்றும் 'பறவைகள் வானில் பறந்தது'", "D": "'மாணவர்கள் வகுப்பிற்கு வந்தது' மற்றும் 'மயில் ஆடியதுகள்'"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பொது இலக்கணம்: மாடுகள் (அஃறிணைப் பன்மை / பலவின்பால்) -> மேய்ந்தன; செழியன் (உயர்திணை / ஆண்பால் ஒருமை) -> படித்தான். இவை இரண்டும் இலக்கண வழுவின்றி முழுமையாகப் பொருந்தியுள்ளன. 'மேய்ந்தது' ஒன்றன்பால் முடிபு; 'ஆடியதுகள்' வழுவுடைய சொல். எனவே தெரிவு A சரியானதாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which of the following options are Thinai, Paal, and Enn agreements constructed without grammatical error?"}], "options": {"A": "'Maadugal pul meynthana' and 'Sezhiyan paadam padithaan'", "B": "'Maadugal pul meynthathu' and 'Kannagi paadam padithaan'", "C": "'Sezhiyan oorukku vanthaal' and 'Paravaigal vaanil paranthathu'", "D": "'Maanavargal vaguppirku vanthathu' and 'Mayil aadiyathugal'"}, "explanation": "'Maadugal' correctly takes Palavinbaal predicate 'meynthana'; 'Sezhiyan' takes Aanpaal 'padithaan'. Both adhere to flawless concord rules. Key A."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 38, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "thinai_paal_mudibu", "application"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q414", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-08-pothu-ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-grammar-maathirai-metrics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழ் எழுத்துகளின் மாத்திரை விதிகளின்படி, 'இரட்டைக்கிளவி' என்னும் சொல்லின் மொத்த மாத்திரை அளவு எத்தனை?"}], "options": {"A": "7 மாத்திரைகள்", "B": "8 மாத்திரைகள்", "C": "8.5 மாத்திரைகள்", "D": "9 மாத்திரைகள்"}, "explanation": "மாத்திரை கணக்கீடு:\nஇ = குறில் (1 மாத்திரை)\nர = குறில் (1 மாத்திரை)\nட் = மெய் (0.5 மாத்திரை)\nடை = நெடில் (2 மாத்திரைகள்)\nக் = மெய் (0.5 மாத்திரை)\nகி = குறில் (1 மாத்திரை)\nள = குறில் (1 மாத்திரை)\nவி = குறில் (1 மாத்திரை)\nமொத்தம் = 1 + 1 + 0.5 + 2 + 0.5 + 1 + 1 + 1 = 8 மாத்திரைகள். சரியான தெரிவு B."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Tamil prosodic duration rules, what is the total measure of Matras (duration) for the word 'இரட்டைக்கிளவி'?"}], "options": {"A": "7 Matras", "B": "8 Matras", "C": "8.5 Matras", "D": "9 Matras"}, "explanation": "I (1) + Ra (1) + T (0.5) + Tai (2) + K (0.5) + Ki (1) + La (1) + Vi (1) = 8 Matras in total. Key B."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 40, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "maathirai", "prosody", "metrics"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q415", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-08-pothu-ilakkanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-grammar-kurippu-application", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மடமடவென முறிந்த மரக்கிளைகள்', 'ஓடி ஓடி இளைத்த கால்கள்' - இத்தொடர்களில் அடிக்கோடிடப்பட்ட 'மடமட' மற்றும் 'ஓடி ஓடி' ஆகிய சொற்களின் முறையான இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "இரண்டும் இரட்டைக்கிளவி", "B": "இரண்டும் அடுக்குத்தொடர்", "C": "முன்னது இரட்டைக்கிளவி; பின்னது அடுக்குத்தொடர்", "D": "முன்னது அடுக்குத்தொடர்; பின்னது இரட்டைக்கிளவி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் இயல் 2 பக்கம் 40: 'மடமட' என்பது பிரித்தால் பொருள் தராமல் இணைந்தே வந்து ஒலிக்குறிப்பைக் காட்டுவதால் 'இரட்டைக்கிளவி' ஆகும். 'ஓடி ஓடி' என்பது பிரித்தாலும் பொருள் தந்து விரைவு/தொடர்ச்சி காரணமாக அடுக்கப்பட்டு வந்ததால் 'அடுக்குத்தொடர்' ஆகும். எனவே சரியான தெரிவு C."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What are the grammatical identifications for the underlined phrases 'Mada Mada' and 'Odi Odi' in the respective expressions?"}], "options": {"A": "Both are Irattai-k-kilavi", "B": "Both are Adukkuthodar", "C": "The former is Irattai-k-kilavi; the latter is Adukkuthodar", "D": "The former is Adukkuthodar; the latter is Irattai-k-kilavi"}, "explanation": "'Mada Mada' conveys sound without separable meaning (Irattai-k-kilavi); 'Odi Odi' conveys separable active meaning repeated for continuation (Adukkuthodar). Key C."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 40, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "ilakkana_kurippu", "application"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q416", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-vazhakku", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-grammar-kadaippoli-odd-one-out", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கீழ்க்காணும் சொற்களுள் 'கடைப்போலி' என்ற இலக்கண வகைக்குப் பொருந்தாத வேறுபட்ட ஒன்றைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்க:"}], "options": {"A": "பந்தர் (பந்தல் என்பதன் கடைப்போலி)", "B": "சாம்பர் (சாம்பல் என்பதன் கடைப்போலி)", "C": "நிலன் (நிலம் என்பதன் கடைப்போலி)", "D": "மைஞ்சு (மஞ்சு என்பதன் முதற்போலி)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் இயல் 1 பக்கம் 18: பந்தர் (ல்->ர்), சாம்பர் (ல்->ர்), நிலன் (ம்->ன்) ஆகிய மூன்றும் சொல்லின் இறுதி எழுத்து மாறிய 'கடைப்போலி' ஆகும். ஆனால் 'மைஞ்சு' என்பது 'மஞ்சு' என்ற சொல்லின் முதல் எழுத்து (ம->மை) மாறிய 'முதற்போலி' ஆகும். எனவே இது பொருந்தாதது (தெரிவு D)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Identify the odd word that does not belong to the category of 'Kadaippoli' (terminal substitute):"}], "options": {"A": "Panthar (terminal substitute for Panthal)", "B": "Saambar (terminal substitute for Saambal)", "C": "Nilan (terminal substitute for Nilam)", "D": "Mainju (initial substitute for Manju)"}, "explanation": "Panthar, Saambar, and Nilan are Kadaippoli (terminal alteration). Mainju is Mutharpoli (initial alteration of Manju). Thus D is the odd one out."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 18, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["grammar", "poli", "kadaippoli", "odd_one_out"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q417", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u3-maanudam", "lesson_id": "lesson-12-vina-vidai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-grammar-nannool-vina-quote-completion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நன்னூலில் வினா வகைகளைக் குறிப்பிடும் பின்வரும் இலக்கண நூற்பா அடியைச் சரியான சொற்களால் நிறைவு செய்க:\n\n'அறிவறியா மையையக் கொளல்கொடை ஏவல்\n________________________________________'"}], "options": {"A": "தரும்வினா ஆறும் இழுக்கார் அறிவுடையோர்", "B": "செப்பும் வினாவும் வழாஅல் ஓம்பல்", "C": "சுட்டுமறை நேர்ஏவல் வினாதல் உற்றதுரைத்தல்", "D": "மொழியின் வழக்கம் முறைமை காத்தல்"}, "explanation": "நன்னூல் நூற்பா 385:\n'அறிவறியா மையையக் கொளல்கொடை ஏவல்\nதரும்வினா ஆறும் இழுக்கார் அறிவுடையோர்'\nஎன்பது அறுவகை வினாக்களைக் குறிக்கும் அதிகாரப்பூர்வ இலக்கண நூற்பாவாகும். எனவே சரியான நிறைவு 'தரும்வினா ஆறும் இழுக்கார் அறிவுடையோர்' (தெரிவு A)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Complete the following Nannool sutra line describing the six question forms:\n\n'Arivariyaa maiyaiyak kolalkodai eval\n________________________________________'"}], "options": {"A": "Tharumvina aarum izhukkaar arivudaiyor", "B": "Seppum vinaavum vazhaal oombal", "C": "Suttumarai nereval vinathal utrathuraithal", "D": "Mozhiyin vazhakku muraimai kaathal"}, "explanation": "Nannool Sutra 385 explicitly concludes: 'tharumvina aarum izhukkaar arivudaiyor'. Key A."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_s