{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q436", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-pyq-bridging", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-thirunelveli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-bridging-works-epithets-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நூல்களையும் அவற்றிற்குரிய சிறப்பு அடைமொழிகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\n1. இரட்சணிய யாத்திரிகம்\n2. வெற்றிவேற்கை\n3. திருக்குற்றாலக் குறவஞ்சி\n4. பழமொழி நானூறு\n\nபட்டியல் II:\na. நறுந்தொகை\nb. குறவஞ்சி நாடகம்\nc. உலகியல் பழமொழிக் களஞ்சியம்\nd. கிறித்தவக் கம்பரின் பெருங்காப்பியம்"}], "options": {"A": "1-b, 2-d, 3-a, 4-c", "B": "1-c, 2-a, 3-d, 4-b", "C": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "D": "1-d, 2-a, 3-b, 4-c"}, "explanation": "இரட்சணிய யாத்திரிகம் - கிறித்தவக் கம்பரின் பெருங்காப்பியம் (1-d); வெற்றிவேற்கை - நறுந்தொகை (2-a); திருக்குற்றாலக் குறவஞ்சி - குறவஞ்சி நாடகம் (3-b); பழமொழி நானூறு - பதினெண்கீழ்க்கணக்குப் பழமொழிக் களஞ்சியம் (4-c). சரியான வரிசை 1-d, 2-a, 3-b, 4-c (தெரிவு D)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the literary compositions with their distinct literary classifications:\nList I:\n1. Ratchanya Yaathrigam\n2. Vetriverkai\n3. Thirukkutrala Kuravanji\n4. Pazhamozhi Nanooru\n\nList II:\na. Narunthogai\nb. Kuravanji Natakam\nc. Worldly Proverb Anthology\nd. Epic of Christian Kamban"}], "options": {"A": "1-b, 2-d, 3-a, 4-c", "B": "1-c, 2-a, 3-d, 4-b", "C": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "D": "1-d, 2-a, 3-b, 4-c"}, "explanation": "Ratchanya Yaathrigam is Christian Kamban's epic (d), Vetriverkai is Narunthogai (a), Kutrala Kuravanji is Kuravanji Natakam (b), Pazhamozhi Nanooru is Proverb Anthology (c). Sequence: 1-d, 2-a, 3-b, 4-c. Key D."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "இரட்சணிய யாத்திரிகம்", "content_en": "Ratchanya Yaathrigam"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "வெற்றிவேற்கை", "content_en": "Vetriverkai"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "திருக்குற்றாலக் குறவஞ்சி", "content_en": "Thirukkutrala Kuravanji"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "பழமொழி நானூறு", "content_en": "Pazhamozhi Nanooru"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "நறுந்தொகை", "content_en": "Narunthogai"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "குறவஞ்சி நாடகம்", "content_en": "Kuravanji Natakam"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "உலகியல் பழமொழிக் களஞ்சியம்", "content_en": "Pathinenkeezhkanakku Proverb Anthology"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "கிறித்தவக் கம்பரின் பெருங்காப்பியம்", "content_en": "Epic of Christian Kamban"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 5, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["bridging", "literary_epithets", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at