{"id": "7th-t3-u4-q437", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u1-nagarigam", "lesson_id": "lesson-09-thirukkural-1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-thirukkural-vocabulary-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருக்குறளில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள அரிய சொற்களையும் அவற்றின் தமிழ்ப் பொருள்களையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\n1. நனைகவுள்\n2. தற்று\n3. ஓவாப் பிணி\n4. செறுபகை\n\nபட்டியல் II:\na. மதநீர் ஒழுகும் கன்னம்\nb. அத்தன்மைத்து\nc. தீராத நோய்\nd. அழிவு செய்யும் பகை"}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c", "C": "1-c, 2-d, 3-a, 4-b", "D": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் திருக்குறள் அரும்பொருள்கள்: நனைகவுள் - மதநீரால் நனைந்த யானைக் கன்னம் (1-a); தற்று - அத்தன்மைத்து (போன்றது) (2-b); ஓவாப் பிணி - நீங்காத நோய் (3-c); செறுபகை - அழிவு செய்யும் பகை (4-d). சரியான வரிசை 1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d (தெரிவு A)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the rare classical terms from Thirukkural with their semantic definitions:\nList I:\n1. Nanaikavul\n2. Thatru\n3. Ovaa-p-pini\n4. Serupagai\n\nList II:\na. Rutting wet temple of an elephant\nb. Of such nature / Likeness\nc. Incurable persistent affliction\nd. Destructive hostile enemy"}], "options": {"A": "1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d", "B": "1-b, 2-a, 3-d, 4-c", "C": "1-c, 2-d, 3-a, 4-b", "D": "1-d, 2-c, 3-b, 4-a"}, "explanation": "Nanaikavul is rutting elephant temple (a), Thatru is 'similar to that' (b), Ovaa-p-pini is persistent disease (c), Serupagai is destructive enemy (d). Order: 1-a, 2-b, 3-c, 4-d. Key A."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "நனைகவுள்", "content_en": "Nanaikavul"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "தற்று", "content_en": "Thatru"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "ஓவாப் பிணி", "content_en": "Ovaa-p-pini"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "செறுபகை", "content_en": "Serupagai"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "மதநீர் ஒழுகும் கன்னம் (யானை)", "content_en": "Rutting temporal gland of an elephant"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "அத்தன்மைத்து (அதைப் போன்றது)", "content_en": "Of such nature / Similar unto that"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "தீராத நோய் (தொடர் பிணி)", "content_en": "Incurable unceasing ailment"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "அழிவு செய்யும் பகை", "content_en": "Destructive belligerent adversary"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 42, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["thirukkural", "vocabulary", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, 